\q2 \rb separates|יַפְרִ֖יד\rb* \rb you|בֵּינִ֥י\rb* \rb and me.”|וּבֵינֵֽךְ׃\rb*
\p \v 18 \rb When Naomi saw|וַתֵּ֕רֶא\rb* \rb that|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb Ruth|הִ֖יא\rb* \rb was determined|מִתְאַמֶּ֥צֶת\rb* \rb to go|לָלֶ֣כֶת\rb* \rb with her,|אִתָּ֑הּ\rb* \rb she stopped|וַתֶּחְדַּ֖ל\rb* \rb trying to persuade her.|לְדַבֵּ֥ר\rb*\rb |אֵלֶֽיהָ׃\rb*
\s1 The Return to Bethlehem
